// This endpoint makes use of a [Hypermedia relation](https://docs.github.com/enterprise-server@3.20/rest/using-the-rest-api/getting-started-with-the-rest-api#hypermedia) to determine which URL to access. The endpoint you call to upload release assets is specific to your release. Use the `upload_url` returned in
